    gate channel, c_2 = 2.9e-03: the lattice modulates delta K/K between 0 (cores) and 3.77e-04 (z <= 4); below CV4's 4.8e-03
    gate channel, c_2 = 7.3e-03: the lattice modulates delta K/K between 0 (cores) and 1.50e-04 (z <= 4); below CV4's 4.8e-03
