    m = 2e-19 eV, spin 0.03: v_rot = 8.5 km/s, l_v = 188.4 pc (8.9e+03 vortices inside 10 kpc), lambda_dB = 4.26e-01 pc;  delta K/K: lattice 1.8e-13, tangle 6.8e-15
